# specrot's own repository. Data, evaluation and docs about obsolete RFCs are accepted wholesale;
# the code and the skill are accepted one RFC at a time, so a new stale citation there fails CI.
* docs/*            # explorer data and its demo text
* scripts/*         # evaluation inputs, labels and results
* facts.json        # numbers about the graph
* README.md         # examples and results about obsolete RFCs
* EVIDENCE.md       # measurements about obsolete RFCs
* action.yml        # example citations
